<figure id="Ax4.T6" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Performance of <span id="Ax4.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stable Diffusion</span> pre-trained on LAION-Aesthetics v2 5+.
Pokémon uses SD v1-4 (fine-tuned) and reports <em id="Ax4.T6.8" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">conditional only</em> (no parentheses).
COCO2017-Val uses SD v1-5 (held-out) and reports in the format <em id="Ax4.T6.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">uncond.%</em> (<math id="Ax4.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta=\textit{cond.}-\textit{uncond.}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF" mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">=</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathcolor="#0000FF">cond.</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathcolor="#0000FF">uncond.</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta=\textit{cond.}-\textit{uncond.}</annotation></semantics></math>).
Best in <span id="Ax4.T6.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, second-best <span id="Ax4.T6.11" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
